  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environment &amp; Aquaculture Governance Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EAG III aims to make aquaculture a sustainable and larger provider for future food security by strengthening the knowledge and capacity on aquaculture governance and management tools and developing network. The project is implemented by Norway&#x2019;s Institute of Marine Research (IMR) in collaboration with Yellow Sea Fisheries Research Institute under Chinese Academy of Fisheries Sciences.</narrative>
  </description>
